WEBVTT

00:00:00.810 --> 00:00:03.700
The hero Sink suddenly 
arrived in Biscotti.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:06.560
But it looks like he's having trouble
getting back to his world.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:08.900
Well that's not our concern.

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.860
So in the meantime,

00:00:10.860 --> 00:00:12.950
we the Genoise have 
kidnapped the princess,

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.280
completely ignoring the 
rules, and declared war!

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:18.450
Now it's my turn to shine!

00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:20.040
Gaul-sama, hooray!!

00:01:57.760 --> 00:02:01.300
Even before the heat of this 
day's battle has cooled,

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.140
it looks like something 
serious is going down!

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.260
Princess Millefiore, representative and

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.420
I, Franboise Charle, am now on my way

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:19.610
to the site to give a special report!

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:23.600
Charge! Princess Recovery Battle!!

00:02:26.830 --> 00:02:27.790
Hey, Eclair!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:29.540
You're just the one I was looking for!

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.420
This is bad... the princess 
has been kidnapped!

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.390
So I have to go to 
save her right away...

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:35.460
You...

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.720
...stupid dumbass!!

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.220
That hurts! What are you doing?

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.030
That's what I should say!

00:02:48.030 --> 00:02:49.310
What were you thinking,

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:51.980
accepting the battle 
without consulting anyone!

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:54.720
Huh?

00:02:57.620 --> 00:03:00.640
I'm sorry, Amelita, I never 
explained to our Hero

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:02.970
how the declaration of battle works.

00:03:03.870 --> 00:03:05.030
Is that so...

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:09.260
Well, um, it's going to be all right...

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:11.290
we'll get the princess back!

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:13.290
But...

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.050
...will we get her back in time?

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:20.160
We can't disappoint all 
those people who have been

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:22.840
looking forward to listening 
the princess sing...

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.870
D... don't worry.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:27.530
The Hero and Eclair are 
already on their way...

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:30.310
...and I will prepare the 
troops and be off immediately.

00:03:34.350 --> 00:03:36.070
You're... Homura?!

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.670
If you accept the declaration of battle,

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.150
it means that we have accepted 
it as an official battle!

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:44.180
If it were an ordinary 
fight it wouldn't matter...

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:45.890
...but you couldn't have 
picked a worse time

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:47.740
than now with the princess 
being kidnapped!

00:03:48.040 --> 00:03:50.110
There's only an hour and a half until

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:52.380
the princess must appear at her concert!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:54.380
Are you listening, Hero?!

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.820
Uh, yeah, I'm listening!

00:03:56.820 --> 00:04:00.360
And why can't you even 
ride a cellkul properly?

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.250
I can't help it!

00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:05.930
Eclair, if you get too worked 
up you'll pop a vein!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.680
Humph!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:12.660
Eclair, Ricotta, I'm sorry...

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:13.810
that I didn't consult you...

00:04:16.310 --> 00:04:17.820
It's just that in my world,

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:19.940
it's a serious thing
to have your princess

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:21.600
kidnapped by your enemy.

00:04:22.490 --> 00:04:25.150
So I couldn't just stand 
there and do nothing.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.080
But it's okay!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:30.830
I will save the princess

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:33.390
and get her back in 
time for the concert!

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:36.710
Huh, of course!

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:40.000
I can't do much but I'll try my best!

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:44.010
Uh huh! Thank you Ricotta and Eclair!

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.810
Oyakata-sama!

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:57.350
Have you found something interesting?

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:01.690
Uh, Yukikaze...

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:05.450
Looks like there's gonna 
be another battle.

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:24.170
I, Godwin, am honored to be 
called on by Prince Gaul.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.670
Well it looked like you

00:05:28.670 --> 00:05:31.010
didn't get your fill in today's battle.

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:35.450
Yes, certainly. I don't 
mind attacking fortresses,

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:38.730
but open field battles are my specialty.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:41.320
Good, well, you can do all 
the fighting you want!

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:44.610
Hey, you should drink and eat!

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:47.670
Yes, sir! As you wish!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:58.670
Oh, and how is Princess Millefiore?

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.270
I left Rouge in charge of everything.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:04.270
She's being taken care of.

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:05.510
I see.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:11.050
And, well... I have some 
ideas about that...

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:26.530
Yes?

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:31.730
Excuse me, Princess. I'm 
sorry for the delay.

00:06:31.730 --> 00:06:33.930
I have brought the Vernon family.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.370
Thank you, Rouge.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:42.850
It's been a while, Vernon...

00:06:42.850 --> 00:06:44.670
I'm glad you're well.

00:06:50.110 --> 00:06:53.680
The children born this 
year are adorable.

00:06:53.800 --> 00:06:57.740
Yes... Prince Gaul thought 
that Vernon would like

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:05.250
Prince Gaul is always so considerate...

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.660
Thank you!

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:07.940
Oh, it's our pleasure.

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:15.080
The battle won't start for a while...

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:19.120
moment to speak with Prince Gaul?

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:21.250
I will get him now.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:24.510
Yes, please... thank you, Rouge.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.320
Vernon, how is your master,

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:47.900
how is Leo-sama?
Is she well?

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:52.440
We used to visit each 
other's countries...

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:55.190
and she was always so good to me...

00:07:58.160 --> 00:08:02.920
But recently, we hardly ever meet...

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:06.890
And when we do all she speaks 
are words of battle...

00:08:07.880 --> 00:08:10.760
Would you tell her...

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.790
that Millefi is feeling very lonely?

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.010
We should wait for the main troops,

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:28.720
but we don't have any time to waste!

00:08:28.720 --> 00:08:29.440
Right!

00:08:30.230 --> 00:08:32.900
I hate to admit it but Prince Gaul's 
soldiers are an elite force.

00:08:33.490 --> 00:08:35.780
It will be tough to beat that number

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:37.210
in an open field battle!

00:08:37.210 --> 00:08:37.780
Yeah...

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.950
But in a past major battle,

00:08:42.290 --> 00:08:44.990
facing more than a thousand 
cavalry soldiers...

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.430
There was a legendary 
knight who singularly cut

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.730
through them to reach the enemy general!

00:09:02.930 --> 00:09:03.730
Really?!

00:09:04.060 --> 00:09:07.480
That means, we can cut through 
a mere hundred soldiers!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:10.610
Right! And we have Rico's support!

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:13.820
There's no way we can 
do it without trying!

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.950
If we don't try, we 
won't get there in time!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.820
We'll cover the shortest 
distance at maximum speed!

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:21.260
Head-on attack!

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:27.320
Captain Droopy Ears and the 
Hero are really coming,

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.250
straight this way!

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:32.250
Okay! We're gonna defeat them!

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:35.110
Archers! Use your bows!

00:09:35.110 --> 00:09:36.430
Yeah!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:38.550
Huh?

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.610
Cannon fire, cannon fire!

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:53.360
It can't be...

00:09:53.860 --> 00:09:55.560
They have artillery men?

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:01.860
Of course we do!

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:05.110
I'm the Chief Biscotti 
Academic Researcher!

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:07.390
Ricotta Elmar!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:25.470
I am in charge of artillery 
in the battlefield!

00:10:41.110 --> 00:10:42.280
This is spectacular!

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:46.540
It's so dark, you can't 
tell what is what...

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:49.830
The young soldiers are doing their best!

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:52.160
But Oyakata-sama...

00:10:52.960 --> 00:10:56.050
This is a battle between 
Biscotti and Galette...

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:02.810
The young soldiers are 
enjoying the battle.

00:11:03.330 --> 00:11:06.530
It would be uncool for 
adults to interfere.

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:11.800
I'll just relax and enjoy the show.

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:24.660
Homura, please take this letter 
to your master right away!

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:42.090
Well, this is quite a grand welcome!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.430
I wouldn't have it any other way!

00:12:23.300 --> 00:12:24.370
Hey, Princess.

00:12:24.370 --> 00:12:25.900
Prince Gaul!

00:12:27.430 --> 00:12:29.740
Please, stay as you are...

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:35.190
I'm sorry for the sudden kidnapping,

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:38.070
but I had my reasons.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:39.720
Of course...

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.110
I'd like to fight with your Hero,

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.020
we can discuss
how I can make it

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.320
up to you and all the fuss later...

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:51.260
Of course, thank you.

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:54.770
Well then, I'll be on my way.

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:12.570
The Captain of the Imperial Knights

00:13:12.570 --> 00:13:14.810
and the Hero are nothing to fear!

00:13:15.580 --> 00:13:18.700
Uh, Rico's artillery 
support has stopped...

00:13:18.700 --> 00:13:19.820
I'm not surprised...

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:23.960
I surrender!

00:13:23.960 --> 00:13:27.100
The artillery is powerless when 
surrounded by foot soldiers.

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:30.200
She deserves praise for 
holding out this long.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:35.380
Our master, Prince Gaul has 
called on the boy Hero.

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:44.390
We have no business with
the little Captain of the Imperial Knights.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:47.840
If you surrender, I'll let you go? Huh?

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:49.090
No thanks!

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:53.100
Well, then...

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:57.190
You'll have to learn your 
lesson the hard way!

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.020
-Eclair...
-Hero...

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:03.100
What!

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:04.340
You're the one...

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:05.760
Now listen...

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:06.830
No, Eclair, you listen!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:09.870
I'll stay here. You go on ahead...

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.350
Hey! Stop saying the same thing!

00:14:14.350 --> 00:14:16.790
You stole my line, you stupid Hero!

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:19.960
Come on, just go!
It's dangerous here.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:22.600
And you know more about the 
inside of the fortress, right?

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:26.760
There's no way you can handle 
a difficult battle like this!

00:14:27.060 --> 00:14:28.680
You go on ahead!

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:31.690
I can't leave a girl in danger!

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:34.050
Whatever! I'm telling you to go!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.630
Leave it to me!

00:14:35.630 --> 00:14:36.740
Whatever! Go!

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:40.850
Stupid brats!

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:45.070
Stop your yapping, this is serious!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:57.250
Remember you're facing me

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.660
and 100 warriors of the Galette army...

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:02.520
...you novice hero and little girl

00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:05.650
who's nothing more than an apprentice!

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:10.690
If you think you can resist...

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:15.930
...why don't you try me?!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:36.410
That sword?!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:39.220
Sorry to interfere.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.370
Hey, it's been a while, Eclair.

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.760
Countess Dalkian!

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.890
Dalkian?

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:55.180
That's right.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.940
This is the first time I've met you,

00:15:58.940 --> 00:16:00.680
General and Hero.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:04.290
I am Brioche Dalkian, 
freelance knight of the

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:07.820
Biscotti Army and head 
of the Covert Force!

00:16:09.740 --> 00:16:12.450
I received a request from 
Rolan, head of the Knights,

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:20.370
Oh! Watch out, behind you!

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:22.870
Seal sword!

00:16:24.790 --> 00:16:26.630
Rekku Ichimonji!

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:47.150
Hey, you saved me, Hero!

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.150
Uh, it was nothing!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:52.240
Um, I was in the middle 
of my introduction...

00:16:56.370 --> 00:17:00.370
Oh well, I'm your uninvited assistant!

00:17:00.760 --> 00:17:03.160
Now let's...

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.600
...have a regular fight!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:14.430
Fireworks?! Who's doing that!

00:17:19.010 --> 00:17:20.350
What?!

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:23.600
I am head of the Covert Force 
of the Biscotti Knights...

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:25.750
Hey, how did you get here!

00:17:26.600 --> 00:17:28.940
Come on, I wish you'd let me finish!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.110
Seal fist!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.450
Yukikaze close combat technique!

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.450
Koryu Rengesyo!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:49.300
Slash!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:59.280
I'm Yukikaze Panettone,
head of the Covert Force

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:01.470
of the Biscotti Knights.

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:04.980
Yukki!

00:18:05.430 --> 00:18:09.080
I got the fireworks and the cannons!

00:18:09.080 --> 00:18:11.230
Nice work, Rico!

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:13.480
Oh, by the way...

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:16.260
...I put all the soldiers that were

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:19.050
holding you captive to sleep...

00:18:19.050 --> 00:18:21.780
Maybe you should help them later on...

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:23.800
Well then, Rico,

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:27.910
let's go to help our Master and Eclair,
 and the others!

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:29.920
Okay, Yukki!

00:18:42.430 --> 00:18:44.910
Oh, they're really at it!

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.090
Let's give them a blast of help!

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:48.810
Yes, let's!

00:18:52.980 --> 00:18:55.940
Rico and Yukki style 
artillery technique!

00:18:55.940 --> 00:18:59.050
Ryoran Daihyakka!

00:19:15.000 --> 00:19:18.150
Eclair! Look! That's crazy!

00:19:18.150 --> 00:19:19.630
Shut up and run!

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.970
Countess Dalkian! I'm Eclair Marinozzi!

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:26.470
Hey!

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:30.560
We'll charge inside and 
rescue the princess!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:33.980
Roger that. Do your best!

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.730
Yukikaze and I will handle this.

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.500
Leave it to us!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:57.250
Gaul... that idiot!

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:59.830
He went and kidnapped her 
without consulting me!

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:03.270
I was at his side the whole time,

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:05.570
but the prince went ahead anyway.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.770
I'm so sorry!

00:20:08.230 --> 00:20:10.630
I won't let a kid mess 
with the strategy of

00:20:10.630 --> 00:20:12.830
the nation and its leader 
for his own amusement!

00:20:16.440 --> 00:20:17.440
Hey!

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:20.570
So you're the Hero of Biscotti?!

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.660
I'm the...

00:20:27.420 --> 00:20:30.360
Not interested in what 
I have to say, huh?

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:38.550
Sorry, but we'll have to save 
introductions for later!

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:41.260
I need to get the princess home now!

00:20:42.980 --> 00:20:46.010
Sure thing! Try it if you can!

00:20:50.980 --> 00:20:54.520
So... the three stooges, 
I should've known...

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:56.340
Who are you calling stooge?

00:20:56.340 --> 00:20:58.210
You're the stooge!

00:20:58.210 --> 00:21:00.030
Stooge! Stooge!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.130
You guys, fighting you guys really gives

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:04.530
me a headache... seriously...

00:21:05.030 --> 00:21:07.070
We're all Imperial guards...

00:21:11.540 --> 00:21:14.150
And I, Vert Faberton am ready

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.250
Well it's three against 
one... but anyway

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:22.550
I, Jaune Crafti will do my best!

00:21:22.840 --> 00:21:25.460
I am Eclair Martinozzi,
Captain of the Imperial Knights

00:21:25.460 --> 00:21:27.230
of the Biscotti Army!

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:30.310
I will cut through you 
and move on ahead!

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:39.480
You're pretty well trained as a knight!

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.740
Wait for me, Princess!

00:21:46.240 --> 00:21:47.780
Any minute now...

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:50.250
I will...

00:21:51.650 --> 00:21:54.610
...come and save you!

00:23:30.740 --> 00:23:32.400
Captain of the Royal Guard Kick!

00:23:33.590 --> 00:23:35.810
We are Genoise!

00:23:35.330 --> 00:23:40.840
<b>Fierce Battle at Fortress Mion</b>

00:23:36.880 --> 00:23:38.840
Please honor us again next time.
